---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<BaseLayout
  title="游戏模块 | WordsMaster"
  description="WordsMaster 游戏模块：浏览器里就能玩的小游戏，支持摄像头手势与鼠标 / 触控操作，全部本地运行。"
  keywords={['小游戏', '切水果', '体感游戏', '手势识别', '浏览器游戏']}
>
  <section class="games-page">
    <div class="games-hero">
      <h1>🎮 游戏模块</h1>
      <p>浏览器里就能玩的小游戏。支持摄像头手势识别与鼠标 / 触控板操作，全部在本地运行，无需安装。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="game-grid">
      <a class="game-card" href={`${base}/games/fruitwave/`}>
        <div class="game-cover">🍉🍓🍍</div>
        <div class="game-body">
          <h2>FruitWave · 切水果</h2>
          <p>90 秒极限切水果，12 种水果等你挑战。有摄像头就伸出食指挥砍，没有摄像头用鼠标 / 触控板一样能玩。</p>
          <div class="game-tags">
            <span>手势识别</span>
            <span>鼠标 / 触控</span>
            <span>本地运行</span>
          </div>
          <div class="game-cta">开始游戏 →</div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="game-card" href={`${base}/games/artcatcher/`}>
        <div class="game-cover">🧸🎁🦄</div>
        <div class="game-body">
          <h2>ArtCatcher · 3D 抓娃娃</h2>
          <p>Three.js 打造的 3D 艺术抓娃娃机：投币、操控机械爪、收集艺术手办，还有成就和图鉴等着你。</p>
          <div class="game-tags">
            <span>3D</span>
            <span>键盘 / 触屏摇杆</span>
            <span>收藏图鉴</span>
          </div>
          <div class="game-cta">开始游戏 →</div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .games-hero {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .games-hero h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .games-hero p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .game-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .game-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--color-text);
    transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
  }

  a.game-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  .game-cover {
    height: 150px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 4rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f1c36, #16264a);
  }

  .game-body {
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .game-body h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  .game-body p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .game-tags {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }

  .game-tags span {
    background: var(--color-surface-alt);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .game-cta {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight:600;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
</style>
